{"id":"e7499072623198aa","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Cardinal8 N Huge Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 N Huge Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 N Huge Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cardinal8-n-huge-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 N Huge Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-huge.md\">../batch18/58-df-huge.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,n,\\eta,c,f\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,n,\\eta,c,f\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> 为序数类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> 为元语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\\)</span> 是类量词，不限制为带集合参数的一阶可定义类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-huge.md\">../batch18/58-df-huge.md</a> 中以 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a> 的满意关系展开的初等性模式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\subseteq V\\times M\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in M\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\">\\(j\\subseteq V\\times M\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in M\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(x)=y\">\\(j(x)=y\\)</span> 仅用于此单值关系的域内。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to M\">\\(f:A\\to M\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\\land f\\subseteq A\\times M\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\in M\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\">\\(f\\in V\\land f\\subseteq A\\times M\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\in M\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\operatorname{Ord}^{n+1}\">\\(c\\in\\operatorname{Ord}^{n+1}\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>、值为序数的集合函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassOrdinalIterate}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\eta,j,\\kappa,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassOrdinalIterate}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\eta,j,\\kappa,n)\\)</span> 及原有方括号接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8NHugeCardinal}_S[\\kappa,n]\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8NHugeCardinal}_S[\\kappa,n]\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassOrdinalIterate}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\eta,j,\\kappa,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Ord}^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(c(0)=\\kappa\\land c(n)=\\eta\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\langle c(i),c(i+1)\\rangle\\in j)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassOrdinalIterate}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\eta,j,\\kappa,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Ord}^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(c(0)=\\kappa\\land c(n)=\\eta\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\langle c(i),c(i+1)\\rangle\\in j)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}n\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8NHugeCardinal}_S[\\kappa,n]\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}j,M\\;\\exists\\eta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\nM\\subseteq V\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)\n\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ClassOrdinalIterate}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\eta,j,\\kappa,n)\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl((f:\\eta\\to M)\\to f\\in M\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}n\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8NHugeCardinal}_S[\\kappa,n]\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}j,M\\;\\exists\\eta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\nM\\subseteq V\\land\\bigl[\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)\n\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ClassOrdinalIterate}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\eta,j,\\kappa,n)\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl((f:\\eta\\to M)\\to f\\in M\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>、临界点与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^n(\\kappa)\">\\(j^n(\\kappa)\\)</span> 序列闭包所定义的对象；有限迭代现在由有穷函数图给出。</li>\n<li>不把任意二元关系误计为序列，也不把初等嵌入限制成可定义类。方括号谓词名与两个实参的顺序不变。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","loca